{
  "name": "Getting the Parts",
  "category": "frozendawn:icarus",
  "icon": "frozendawn:data_slate",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "The frame, ports, dock, reserve bank and controller are crafted. The $(bold)Halsey Core$(), $(bold)Field Stabilizers$(), $(bold)Matter Injector$() and $(bold)Antiparticle Foundry$() are printed in the $(l:fabricator/overview)Fabricator$(/l)."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Project Icarus",
      "text": "Printing them needs the $(bold)Project Icarus$() $(l:fabricator/slates)Data Slate$(/l). Look in Helion site log desks and Uplink supply drops.$(br2)The Halsey Core needs SFR-1 \"Solstice\" parts and helium."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Building",
      "text": "Place the Controller and use it: a ghost guide shows every block, in build order, with what is still missing.$(br2)The structure is open, 17x17 and 8 tall. Keep the space around the core clear."
    },
